<p>A <code>calendarTableFoot</code> is one part of a
  <a href="/components/calendar-table/"><code>calendarTable</code></a>.
  It maps to the native HTML <code>&lt;tfoot&gt;</code>
  element. See the <a href="/components/calendar-table/">Calendar Table
  demo</a> for composed examples.</p>

{# BEGIN generated: examples (bin/generate-examples) #}
<h2>Usage</h2>
<pre tabindex="0"><code>{% raw %}&lt;CalendarTable label="April 2026"&gt;
  &lt;CalendarTableHead&gt;...&lt;/CalendarTableHead&gt;
  &lt;CalendarTableBody&gt;...&lt;/CalendarTableBody&gt;
  &lt;CalendarTableFoot&gt;
    &lt;CalendarTableRow&gt;
      &lt;td colspan="7"&gt;5 events this month&lt;/td&gt;
    &lt;/CalendarTableRow&gt;
  &lt;/CalendarTableFoot&gt;
&lt;/CalendarTable&gt;
{% endraw %}</code></pre>
